## DJ Set, Live Band or Duo: What You Actually Need

Whatever the format, the base need is the same: PA sound that reaches the crowd, a microphone, and lighting that sets the mood. Our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers exactly that: 2 active speakers with stands, 1 wired dynamic microphone, and 2 RGBW LED light bars, delivered, installed and tested by our crew.

This is a self run setup: no technician is included, so a DJ or band brings their own mixing gear and controls their own set. If you want a technician on site, our [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include one, though they are sized for a wedding or corporate event rather than a standalone performance.

