## Outdoor Venues: Villas, Terraces and Beach Clubs

Most music performances we cover happen outdoors: a villa terrace, a beach club, a rooftop. Our PA sound and lighting travel to these venues, and a smoke machine is available as an add on for extra atmosphere. Confirm the venue's mains power when you book so we can size the setup correctly. If you are still weighing how much PA power a given guest count actually needs, our [sound system rental](/blog/sound-system-rental/) guide breaks it down package by package.

