## FAQs

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a music performance?

Pricing depends on the package: our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers PA sound, a microphone and lighting, with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and the price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### Is a technician included for a music performance?

No, not on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/): it is a self run setup, delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then operated by the DJ or band themselves. A technician is included on our Wedding Pack and MICE Pack, though those are sized for a wedding or corporate event.

### What is the difference between a setup for a DJ and a live band?

The base equipment is the same: PA sound, a microphone and lighting. A DJ typically brings their own mixer and controller and plugs into our sound system. A live band or duo uses the microphone for vocals and plugs their own instruments in directly.

### How many microphones are included?

The Eco Pack includes 1 wired dynamic microphone. If your performance needs more than one, let us know when you book.

### Can the sound system be used outdoors, at a villa or beach venue?

Yes. Our PA sound and lighting are set up regularly at villas, terraces and beach venues across the Costa del Sol. Confirm the venue's mains power when you book so we can size the setup correctly.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a music performance?

Book as early as you can once your event date and venue are confirmed. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros, and we recommend booking at least 24 hours in advance.
